{"id":"fe922790-c0a8-4f89-ad02-39af41e97b89","object":"chat.completion","created":1784999093,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"implementation\":\"def solve(case):\\n    nodes = case[\\\"nodes\\\"]\\n    required_symbols = case[\\\"required_symbols\\\"]\\n    node_map = {n[\\\"id\\\"]: n for n in nodes}\\n\\n    retained = set()\\n    # initially retain all non-removable nodes\\n    for n in nodes:\\n        if not n[\\\"removable\\\"]:\\n            retained.add(n[\\\"id\\\"])\\n\\n    # ensure every retained node's ancestors are also retained (tree connectivity)\\n    def ensure_ancestors(nid):\\n        node = node_map[nid]\\n        pid = node[\\\"parent\\\"]\\n        while pid is not None:\\n            if pid in retained:\\n                break\\n            retained.add(pid)\\n            pid = node_map[pid][\\\"parent\\\"]\\n\\n    # initial propagation\\n    for nid in list(retained):\\n        ensure_ancestors(nid)\\n\\n    # satisfy required symbols\\n    for sym in required_symbols:\\n        # check if already covered by retained nodes\\n        if any(node_map[nid][\\\"symbol\\\"] == sym for nid in retained):\\n            continue\\n        # find the best removable candidate (highest utility)\\n        candidates = [n for n in nodes if n[\\\"symbol\\\"] == sym and n[\\\"removable\\\"]]\\n        if not candidates:\\n            # required symbol missing (shouldn't happen in valid input)\\n            continue\\n        best = max(candidates, key=lambda n: n[\\\"utility\\\"])\\n        retained.add(best[\\\"id\\\"])\\n        ensure_ancestors(best[\\\"id\\\"])\\n\\n    # compute removed set\\n    all_ids = set(node_map.keys())\\n    removed = all_ids - retained\\n\\n    return {\\n        \\\"removed_node_ids\\\": sorted(removed),\\n        \\\"retained_node_ids\\\": sorted(retained)\\n    }\\n\"}","reasoning_content":"We need to parse the problem. The user gives a task specification: \"SE-P